Description: OpenCode Go usage monitoring desktop app (Linux amd64)
 Fetches opencode.ai usage records via the SolidStart Server Function +
 seroval protocol and provides a local PySide6 dashboard: overview,
 records, analytics, multi-sheet export and settings. Bundled PyInstaller
 build, self-contained (no system Python runtime required).
